{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Capture the flag, but it's you versus yourself.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everytime you capture the flag, time gets rewinded and you play a new clone in the opposite team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896570/extras/dc41cf1691a1307ff60042edb1391744.poster.avif?t=1757516674\" width=456 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896570/extras/dc41cf1691a1307ff60042edb1391744.webm?t=1757516674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896570/extras/dc41cf1691a1307ff60042edb1391744.mp4?t=1757516674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, jump and shoot your way to the other flag before a clone from the other team captures yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be clever about it, because survival is paramount, and your actions may well haunt your future selves... And chaos comes at you fast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896570/extras/eedd1e7e3c47d9d11100a2203f03c5ea.poster.avif?t=1757516674\" width=456 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896570/extras/eedd1e7e3c47d9d11100a2203f03c5ea.webm?t=1757516674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896570/extras/eedd1e7e3c47d9d11100a2203f03c5ea.mp4?t=1757516674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reaching certain numbers of flags will let you unlock medals, which can then be used to enable power-ups and special abilities. Double-jump, set up mines, activate traps, use lightsabers and rocket launchers and more! Did we mention terrain was destructible?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896570/extras/4ba09da9296f3e7b9790df78d231cc2e.poster.avif?t=1757516674\" width=456 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896570/extras/4ba09da9296f3e7b9790df78d231cc2e.webm?t=1757516674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896570/extras/4ba09da9296f3e7b9790df78d231cc2e.mp4?t=1757516674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features 8 unique levels to progress through, from a radio tower, to the warping crystal mines and the low-gravity asteroid fields. Toggle and combine upgrades with your medal budget, and revisit the different levels to earn even more medals!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896570/extras/024e7c0958e9437f1a52d48b8a52f481.poster.avif?t=1757516674\" width=456 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896570/extras/024e7c0958e9437f1a52d48b8a52f481.webm?t=1757516674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896570/extras/024e7c0958e9437f1a52d48b8a52f481.mp4?t=1757516674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plays entirely with the keyboard, or with a gamepad. Takes 2 to 4 hours to complete.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3896570?t=1757516674","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3896570?t=1757516674","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896570/04f6fecbc1fb37e74db31b4f61ba92f47e012486/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757516674","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896570/04f6fecbc1fb37e74db31b4f61ba92f47e012486/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757516674","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Capture the flag, but it's you versus yourself.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everytime you capture the flag, time gets rewinded and you play a new clone in the opposite team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896570/extras/dc41cf1691a1307ff60042edb1391744.poster.avif?t=1757516674\" width=456 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896570/extras/dc41cf1691a1307ff60042edb1391744.webm?t=1757516674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896570/extras/dc41cf1691a1307ff60042edb1391744.mp4?t=1757516674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, jump and shoot your way to the other flag before a clone from the other team captures yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be clever about it, because survival is paramount, and your acti